"Kumanu kom!" imperiously says Doyle.

The Chief slowly comes to you, without taking his eyes off the flame. You give him the torch, and he accepts it with a slightly shaking hand. He could hardly believe the flame was real.

"Ugga!" shouts the chief, lifting the torch high. "Ugga nok!"

"Ugga!" echo his fellow tribesmen.

"Rezhak dadd!" drowning yells of the natives, thunderously herald Doyle, pointing at Snoopy.

A few savages rush up to the cage, get Snoopy, and drag him by the rope to you. You understand that Doyle requested a due sacrifice. Finally, Snoopy is near. He yelps and tries to lick your nose; by shaking hands, you try to calm him down. The savages that brought Snoopy promptly run back and kneel. Only the chief remains standing. He looks with gratitude at the torch in his hand, and his eyes shine with happiness.